          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Diyelim ki aynı oyuncuyla ilgili iki değişkenimiz, <code>playerName</code> ve <code>playerHealth</code>, var.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerName</code>, ardından <code>playerHealth</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oyuncumuzu tanımlamak için iki ayrı değişken kullanmak yerine, bunları <strong>nesne</strong> olarak bilinen tek bir değişkende gruplayabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>player</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesneleri değişkenlere benzer şekilde oluştururuz; <code>const</code> anahtar sözcüğünün ardından bir ad, eşittir işareti ve küme parantezleri <code>{}</code> gelir. Örneğin: <code>const player = {};</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>player</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>{}</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesnenin içindeki bilgiler, nesnenin <strong>özellikleri</strong> olarak bilinir. Özellikler, nesnenin süslü parantezlerinin <code>{}</code> içine yazılır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>name: \"Nova\"</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Özellikleri bir adla başlayıp ardından iki nokta <code>:</code> ve bir değer gelecek şekilde oluştururuz; örneğin <code>health: 100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>health</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>100</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
