            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir nesne oluşturduğumuzda eşittir işaretinden sonra ne gelir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Süslü parantezler <code>{}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parantezler <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Süslü parantezler <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Özelliği <code>player</code> nesnesine grupla.</p><code name=\"script1.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>name:</code> ve sonra <code>\"Nova\"</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
