          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesneye daha fazla özellik eklemek için virgülle başla, ardından özelliği ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>className: \"Archer\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesne, her özellik virgülle ayrıldığı sürece istediğimiz kadar özelliğe sahip olabilir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesne özellikleri sayılar, dizeler, boolean değerler, diziler veya hatta diğer nesneler olabilir. <br /><br />Nesnenin <code>health</code> özelliğini <code>100</code> sayısına ayarla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>100</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148575,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>console.log()</code> kullanarak <code>player</code> nesnemizin içeriğini görüntüleyebiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console.log</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>player</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148576,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesnenin özelliğine; nesne adını, bir <code>.</code> işaretini ve özellik adını kullanarak, <code>player.health</code> örneğindeki gibi erişiriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>player</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>health</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148577,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir özellik değerine eriştikten sonra, eşittir işaretini kullanarak bu değeri güncelleyebiliriz. Örneğin, <code>player.health = 80</code> kodunu yazmayı dene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.health = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>player.health = 80</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
